# This repository tracks the AUDIT METHODOLOGY ONLY — the standing instructions, the agent
# contract, and the orchestration scripts. It deliberately does NOT track the audits: each
# `<name>-verified/` fork cloned into this workspace is its own repository, and may hold working
# reproducers for unfixed defects. `esbmc/` and `formal-tools/` are third-party tool checkouts.
#
# The policy is allowlist, not denylist: everything at the root is ignored, and the few
# methodology paths are re-included below. A fork cloned here next month is therefore ignored
# by default rather than depending on someone remembering to add a rule.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/SECURITY.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.claude/
!/.orchestrator/

# .claude/ — only the shared permission rules, which are part of the safety posture CLAUDE.md
# describes. Personal overrides (settings.local.json) stay local.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json

# .orchestrator/ — the contract, scripts and templates, but not runtime state. Lock files,
# watchdog logs, FIFO tickets and heartbeats are per-run artifacts and are recreated on demand.
/.orchestrator/*.lock
/.orchestrator/*.log
/.orchestrator/agents/
/.orchestrator/fuzzq/
/.orchestrator/reports/
